</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Right shift (<code>&gt;&gt; n</code>)</strong>: Shifts the bits =
of a number to the right by <code>n</code> positions, discarding bits on th=
e right. This is equivalent to dividing a number by <code>2n</code> (intege=
r division).</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
